WEBVTT

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:13.750
<b>Ordarion</b>

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:42.960
Slim pickings, it seems.

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:48.130
He's gone, then?

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:51.380
He is. Didn't take a single request.

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:52.670
Let's talk out back.

00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:00.630
A young adventurer with black hair and dark eyes...

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.080
So that was this Yuji fellow.

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:06.380
Seems that way. He was one of our
former potential assassination targets.

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:11.830
Headquarters didn't seem to think
he was much of a concern.

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.170
But that's only according to some fringe assassins.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:17.750
We can't trust the likes of them.

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:20.580
We're better off eliminating him while we can.

00:01:21.170 --> 00:01:23.290
That'd stir up trouble.

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:26.540
And if we end up blowing
the Blue Moon of Salvation's cover,

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:28.580
these years of careful scheming will be all for nothing.

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:32.460
Why do you think we went so far
as to procure an artificial rain machine?

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:40.920
Didn't work though, did it? Sure, it rained.
But someone out there took down the Fire Dragon.

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:45.080
We should inform Master Walter
before we make any move.

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:47.580
"Walter"?

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:25.540
Brushing things off with a "whatever"

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:28.710
Stuck later in an unchanging life

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:30.960
The whatevers became habit

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:34.210
My skills still have yet to bloom

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:39.170
If I don't try to win and am willing to lose

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:44.830
Why does this cold heart still beat with time?

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:51.130
All of us are monsters with hidden powers

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:56.710
Are we going to live without awakening them?

00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:00.000
We push things down and cover them up

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.880
And our hearts are fresh no more

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:07.670
But we're monsters who continue on without so much as a face

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:14.080
All of us have undiscovered powers hidden inside

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:17.920
You're up next

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:23.630
Stand and face it monster

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:46.330
As you wish.

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:57.130
Father Steyl, you say a revelation brought you here?

00:03:57.460 --> 00:04:00.630
Indeed. We have awaited your arrival.

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:05.540
The guild here seems to be
in the Blue Moon of Salvation's hands.

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:09.540
It would appear so. But here we are safe.

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:13.170
I sure hope so.

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.790
They seemed to know about you.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:23.330
To that regard, there is something you must know.

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:27.880
About my past with the man known as Walter.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:37.290
There was once a group known
as the Church of the Blue Moon.

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:43.790
It's not something I'm proud of, but I was once
a much more unruly man than you might imagine.

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:53.250
It all started as a sort of act,
something we did to honor our fallen comrades.

00:04:56.670 --> 00:05:02.920
But soon we found followers among
the outcast and the downtrodden.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:07.040
Walter was one among their numbers.

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:15.540
He was a man of extreme faith.
One who poured his soul into reverence for the divine.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:20.250
The people welcomed him,
and before long he stood as my right-hand man.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:25.040
Or at least, so I was led to believe.

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:30.380
Truth is his ambitions ran wild
and he found my presence quite disagreeable.

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:35.290
One day the divine above graced me with guidance.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:40.500
It bade me to dismantle the Church of the Blue Moon.

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:47.580
Unable to give up my companions,
I chose not to heed this command.

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:55.290
Mere days later, the Church was attacked.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:06:00.170
My companions allowed me my escape,
but everyone else met their end.

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:04.830
The divine word I had received
was meant to warn me of this event.

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:14.040
The attack was an attempt to take over
the growing Church of the Blue Moon.

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:19.170
And was led by none other than Walter.

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:27.000
He twisted the faith of our followers to suit his needs,
taking our philosophy to the extreme,

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:30.920
and focusing their cause
on "cleansing" this world of ours.

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:35.420
That was the birth of the Blue Moon of Salvation.

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:43.790
Walter seems to have taken control of this region,
and has concocted seemingly wicked plans.

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:47.670
I came here to warn you of this.

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:52.460
I never would have guessed this cult started with you.

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:56.000
That fact is why I feel such a duty here.

00:06:56.790 --> 00:07:00.330
The revelation which led me here
may have been the divine's way

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:03.710
of commanding me to put a stop to Walter's ways.

00:07:04.210 --> 00:07:07.130
Earlier I received word from above yet again.

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:08.880
Johann.

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:21.460
"Chaos shall rise, the masses led astray
by a tainted light."

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:26.420
"Guide the emissary, and grace shall be yours again."

00:07:30.290 --> 00:07:31.710
What's that supposed to mean?

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:36.920
We can think of the Blue Moon of Salvation
and Walter, himself as the "tainted light,"

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:39.750
leading the world into chaos.

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:45.380
But an emissary of the divine will stand to face him.

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:47.080
Right...

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:52.580
Yuji, I believe you will be brought to face Walter.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:55.710
Maybe, but I'm not this emissary.

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:00.710
The legends say this:

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:05.250
"He who wields the Dagger of Kethis
comes sent by the divine."

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:11.330
I ask that you prepare yourself.

00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:14.500
May the grace of the divine watch over you.

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:26.670
That man was the emissary?

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:28.880
Johann...

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:33.000
Why didn't you tell him of the whole revelation?

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:35.500
There was more to it than that...

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:39.500
I did it to protect him.

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:45.790
If he knew the full truth,
he would surely turn his back to the divine word.

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:56.830
Master Walter.

00:08:57.290 --> 00:09:02.670
Our lookouts say Steyl met with one
who may be the emissary today in Ordarion.

00:09:03.170 --> 00:09:04.920
The tamer, is it?

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:07.080
I trust there will be no missteps?

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:10.170
No sir, all arrangements are in place.

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:12.040
Be gone, then.

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:12.750
Yessir!

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:38.670
Oh great divine, my ears are yours...

00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:47.630
"Chaos shall rise, the masses
led astray by a tainted light."

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:56.750
"Guide the emissary, and grace shall be yours again."

00:09:58.710 --> 00:10:03.420
"Then, by the death of you
who offers guidance, shall the sage arise."

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:21.750
Death awaits the sage's guide...

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:31.000
Walter and Steyl...

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:35.040
I get their story, but me, a divine emissary?

00:10:36.710 --> 00:10:39.420
I only have this thing because Steyl gave it to me.

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:42.750
He goes on about these legends, but...

00:10:43.460 --> 00:10:44.790
Wait, legends...

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:48.580
I didn't know magic like that really existed.

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:53.380
Well, I think I heard about it
at one of the churches before.

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:58.630
There was a legend of a mighty beast master
who used slimes to transport things.

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:01.250
I forgot about that.

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:03.630
Better ask about it tomorrow.

00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:11.080
He's gone?

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:15.380
Seems he was called away by pressing matters.

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:18.880
He left with his aide at morning's break.

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:20.500
Well, there goes that.

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:32.040
We headed out?

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.630
For a bit.

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:35.080
Slimes.

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:36.170
Yeah?

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:38.000
Need something?

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:40.670
Any of you see two people in holy robes leave town?

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:42.630
One would have had a white head of hair.

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:44.880
Can't say I have.

00:11:45.710 --> 00:11:46.960
Anyone else?

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:48.540
Nope.

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:50.040
Haven't seen 'em.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:51.290
I did!

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:55.420
They left extra early this morning.

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:57.580
Headed off deep into the woods.

00:11:57.790 --> 00:12:00.170
All right, follow after them.

00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:04.290
Feel free to bring any slimes in the forest
along with you if you need.

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:06.250
Okay!

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:07.880
We got this!

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:09.540
Let's move.

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:10.830
Right with ya!

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:21.420
Father, there's something ahead.

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:25.420
Indeed. A curse placed by men's hands.

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:30.170
Oh gods of old, grant me your strength.

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:34.210
Upon this barrier of darkness, lend your liberating light.

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:37.960
By your blessing I cast away the darkness of chaos.

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:51.920
Come.

00:13:12.210 --> 00:13:15.290
They do not appear to be in this vicinity.

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:16.880
They weren't over here.

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:18.710
Or here!

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:21.080
Where did they go?

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:23.380
No one over here, either.

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:26.380
<b>Monster</b>

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:26.380
<b>Slime</b>

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:26.380
<b>Tamed</b>

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:26.380
<b>Monster</b>

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:26.380
<b>Slime</b>

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:26.380
<b>Tamed</b>

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:26.380
<b>Monster</b>

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:26.380
<b>Slime</b>

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:26.380
<b>Tamed</b>

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:26.380
<b>Monster</b>

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:26.380
<b>Slime</b>

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:26.380
<b>Tamed</b>

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:26.380
<b>Monster</b>

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:26.380
<b>Slime   </b>

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:26.380
<b>Tamed</b>

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:26.380
<b>Monster</b>

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:26.380
<b>Slime</b>

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:26.380
<b>Tamed</b>

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:30.420
I know I said they could bring along help,
but isn't this a bit much?

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:33.540
I saw a man with white hair!

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:36.630
He went into this really dark place!

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:37.880
What sort of dark place?

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:41.330
I know that place! It's super scary!

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:43.130
No one can get inside.

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:45.670
Even if you did, you'd never get out!

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:48.130
Sounds like a bad sort of spot.

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:50.130
Show me the way.

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:52.210
Okay!

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:08.670
Father...

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:12.880
It appears they have no intention
of letting us through peacefully.

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:17.460
Anti-Magic Barrier!

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:18.790
Defense Boost!

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:24.670
What is this...?

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:34.250
May the grace of the divine be with us.

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:38.330
This the place?

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:41.130
Yup! The dark place!

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:43.250
They went inside here.

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:45.170
It's so spooky...

00:14:45.170 --> 00:14:47.330
Doesn't look too inviting...

00:14:53.250 --> 00:14:54.500
Dispel Curse - Extreme!

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:04.420
All right. Follow me.

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:06.170
R-right with ya.

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:07.330
Yay! Let's go!

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:33.540
How long has it been, Steyl?

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:36.540
Walter...

00:15:37.630 --> 00:15:39.790
The holy word has led you to us, then?

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:44.460
"By the death of you who offers guidance,
shall the sage arise."

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:46.960
I come here knowing what that means.

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:51.170
This time at last I will do what has been asked of me.

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:56.380
Turning my back on such before
cost the lives of all those I held dear...

00:15:58.290 --> 00:16:01.080
I will not make that same mistake again!

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:05.250
Let us grant you what you come ready to receive, then!

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:23.290
They're all out cold!

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:25.290
Wow, look at that!

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:27.710
What happened...?

00:16:48.460 --> 00:16:50.540
Not bad, Steyl.

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:54.830
You remind me of our days of old.

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:56.880
I ask you not judge me lightly.

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:59.330
I stand strong now as I did then.

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:01.040
So it would seem.

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:06.580
Which is precisely why I have prepared
so carefully for this very moment.

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:14.460
Wh-when did you learn to command magic?

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:34.710
Johann...

00:17:37.130 --> 00:17:38.630
Now it's all so clear.

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:42.790
You used me to lead the emissary here.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:47.170
I have been dancing in your hand all along, haven't I?

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:53.040
It all started with a single magic stone.

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:59.830
We left one in the wild,
but someone managed to lift its curse.

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:06.750
My mission was to eliminate whoever it was
before they could interfere with our plans.

00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:13.290
But they were far more powerful
than we had ever imagined.

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:17.960
The monsters we created were no match for them.

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:21.960
And just when we were struggling to identify them...

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:27.170
...the moon turned blue and
an ancient dragon descended upon us!

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:31.790
I'm certain I don't need to tell you what unfolded next.

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:33.920
Isn't that right, Johann?

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:40.130
Yes, Steyl granted the emissary the Dagger of Kethis.

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:45.580
Hearing the word of the divine,
he took the dagger from the capital.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:52.580
We can be certain the emissary used
the dagger's powers to defeat the ancient beast.

00:18:55.000 --> 00:19:00.380
From that night on, the two of us
have remained in hiding.

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:04.830
I imagine he worried we would expose the
emissary's identity to the Blue Moon of Salvation

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.130
if we remained in contact.

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:12.710
But even still, the emissary pursued the cause
and fought off our henchmen.

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:24.630
Even when we sought to use the Dragon's Grace to
harness the power of the great, slumbering Fire Dragon...

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:28.330
...the dragon was defeated,
and our plans foiled once again.

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:36.380
It's all true. The emissary is more powerful than
I ever imagined. He has saved us from certain peril.

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:39.290
But that all ends here.

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:43.210
Our operation has now moved on to its next level.

00:19:43.670 --> 00:19:49.670
By the new word of our divine we will
at last achieve the world we all strive for!

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:55.080
Watch in despair, Steyl!

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:58.460
Your efforts are naught but smoke in the wind!

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:02.040
This tainted world will watch as you perish!

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:05.290
The divine will now stand on our side!

00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:09.630
My life was meant to be given up for the emissary.

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:11.710
I fear not the end which approaches.

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:16.210
I offer it now for all our companions
who fell by your wickedness!

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:26.380
Should I die here now, the emissary shall appear
and see your schemes are all brought to an end.

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:32.750
If you truly wish to die before knowing the truth,
far be it from me to deny you of it!

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:41.000
How can this be?!

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:45.380
My followers have all been cursed from the start.

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:49.790
So this is the "tainted light..."

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:54.500
How wicked can you be to curse your very own people?!

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:58.460
Old friend, how I have longed to see that face.

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:03.040
A face as full of hatred as it is of disgrace!

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:06.460
It pleases me to see you now at your very end.

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:20.380
Father Steyl.

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:24.380
There's something I need to ask you.

00:21:32.170 --> 00:21:35.040
I guess now's not really the time, is it?

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:40.500
<b>EPISODE 10</b>

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:40.500
<b>DIDN'T SEEM LIKE A GOOD TIME FOR THAT</b>

00:21:40.830 --> 00:21:43.170
Time to eat! Da da da dan!

00:21:43.420 --> 00:21:46.130
Exploration and procurement are our specialties

00:21:46.130 --> 00:21:47.580
"Be sure to bring lots of friends!"

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:51.380
There's always an encounter one step away from town

00:21:51.380 --> 00:21:52.710
"Agh, I'm starved! My strength is gone!"

00:21:52.710 --> 00:21:54.170
"Look at all these tough baddies!"

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:55.540
"This is ridic! Seriously ridic!"

00:21:55.540 --> 00:22:00.750
"Crazy, wild, and super glaring!"

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:57.830
"Well it seems time we use our secret weapon!"

00:21:57.830 --> 00:21:59.460
"Since when do we have one?"

00:21:59.460 --> 00:22:01.750
"I say we ruuun!"

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:04.960
But we wound up surrounded

00:22:06.080 --> 00:22:10.380
We're about to experience annihilation!

00:22:12.130 --> 00:22:18.250
Brave heroes stand and fight!

00:22:18.420 --> 00:22:19.670
"Firepower boosting potions"

00:22:19.670 --> 00:22:20.750
"The more you chew, the more you get super healed"

00:22:20.750 --> 00:22:23.790
Strength strength coursing through us

00:22:23.790 --> 00:22:26.750
Here's some leaves!

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:26.750
"Let's take them!"

00:22:26.750 --> 00:22:29.080
Time to eat! Da da da dan!

00:22:30.580 --> 00:22:35.580
This food we finally got our hands on is great, huh?

00:22:35.710 --> 00:22:38.330
Whether in caves or in the lost woods,

00:22:38.330 --> 00:22:41.330
Oh we eat our fill from nature's buffet

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:46.380
Can't fight on an empty stomach!

00:22:46.500 --> 00:22:51.540
Let's go, give it a fusion attack! A super strong magical one

00:22:51.630 --> 00:22:54.630
Split the earth and breathe fire!

00:22:54.630 --> 00:22:56.040
"Ultimate super-powered magic!"

00:22:56.040 --> 00:22:57.420
"A jewelry box of magical power and cheats!"

00:22:57.420 --> 00:22:58.830
"Hellfire of Demise will get them all in one go!"

00:22:58.830 --> 00:23:01.630
"That was all in your dreams, right?"

00:23:00.790 --> 00:23:04.250
A CHEST!

00:23:01.630 --> 00:23:06.750
Yuji! Yuji! The best! The Sage! Yuji! Yuji! Oooh tame me!

00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:09.080
Time to eat! Da da da dan!

00:23:10.710 --> 00:23:13.540
Time for an isekai preview from us- AGH!

00:23:14.170 --> 00:23:15.710
I am but a slime...

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:17.670
Something's wrong with this guy.

00:23:17.670 --> 00:23:20.540
Something terrible is about to happen.

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:21.920
Terrible how?

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:24.460
Like, really bad.

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:25.960
Bad how?

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:28.210
Like, really really troubling.

00:23:28.330 --> 00:23:29.710
Just spit it out already!

00:23:29.710 --> 00:23:31.330
Yuji will...

00:23:31.960 --> 00:23:33.790
Huh? Was I saying something?

00:23:33.790 --> 00:23:35.130
You don't remember the rest?!

00:23:35.130 --> 00:23:37.290
"The revelation came true!"

00:23:35.380 --> 00:23:40.420
<b>THE REVELATION CAME TRUE</b>

00:23:37.380 --> 00:23:38.750
What's gonna happen, though?!
